{{!-- subject: We received your order {{orderNumber}} --}}
<h1 style="margin:16px 0 8px 0;font-size:20px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-0.02em;">
  Thank you — we have your order
</h1>

<p style="margin:0 0 4px 0;">Hello {{customerName}},</p>

<p style="margin:12px 0 0 0;color:#3f3f46;">
  We received order <strong style="color:#18181b;">{{orderNumber}}</strong> on {{placedAt}}. We will
  email you again as soon as it is confirmed and on its way.
</p>

<h2
  style="margin:24px 0 0 0;font-size:12px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.04em;color:#71717a;font-weight:600;"
>
  What you ordered
</h2>

{{> order-items-table items=items}}

{{> price-summary itemsSubtotal=itemsSubtotal hasDiscount=hasDiscount
discountTotal=discountTotal shippingUnpriced=shippingUnpriced shippingFee=shippingFee
grandTotal=grandTotal paymentMethod=paymentMethod amountDueOnDelivery=amountDueOnDelivery}}

<h2
  style="margin:24px 0 0 0;font-size:12px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.04em;color:#71717a;font-weight:600;"
>
  Delivering to
</h2>

{{> address-block shippingAddress=shippingAddress}}

{{> button url=orderUrl label="View your order"}}

<p style="margin:0;font-size:13px;color:#71717a;">
  Current status: {{status}}. You can follow it, or cancel while it is still unconfirmed, from your
  order page.
</p>
